  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not everyone knows how to use Blender and Unity, those are very powerful tools with tons of complex features and not everyone has the time, patience or technical knowledge to learn how to use them.\n\nNow im not saying drop support for Blender and Unity Creations, far from it, some amazing and complex things can be made with them, and an advanced user may opt to use them to create awesome things.\n\nBut a less technically inclined player may want to still create an avatar or build their own world using an in-game editor that can be used in both VR and Desktop.\n\nOne example i can give is how World Editing is made in RecRoom. Its super simple and intuitive and allows for some amazing worlds. Im sure the VRChat team can come up with something nice that would give less tech savvy people the ability to be creative in VRC.\n\nThank you",
